{"id":"d0244462250ae67e","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-ground.md","title":"Ground Model","display":"df-ground — Ground Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ground","aliases":["58-df-ground","58-df-zfc-ground-model","58-df-zfc-forcing-ground","58-df-zfc-inner2-ground-model","58-df-zfc-inner4-ground-model","58-df-zfc-model8-ground-model"],"display":"df-ground — Ground Model","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ground"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ground</span><span>58-df-zfc-ground-model</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-ground</span><span>58-df-zfc-inner2-ground-model</span><span>58-df-zfc-inner4-ground-model</span><span>58-df-zfc-model8-ground-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ground — Ground Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"150182b44c47c043\" href=\"?note=150182b44c47c043\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md\">58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1de28866aa4ef668\" href=\"?note=1de28866aa4ef668\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,W\">\\(V,W\\)</span> (class-model parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S\\)</span> (含所有序数的传递 ZFC 类模型谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"150182b44c47c043\" href=\"?note=150182b44c47c043\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md\">58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S\\)</span> (集合迫使扩张谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1de28866aa4ef668\" href=\"?note=1de28866aa4ef668\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\)</span> (本文件定义的基模型谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;W\\subseteq V\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(W)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists P,G\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(V,W,P,G)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;W\\subseteq V\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(W)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists P,G\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(V,W,P,G)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A ground model is a transitive ZFC class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> containing all ordinals such that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is a set-forcing extension of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>; both clauses now reuse their exact book predicates instead of the unsourced symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(W\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=W[G]\">\\(V=W[G]\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>本定义允许平凡迫使给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=V\">\\(W=V\\)</span>；“proper ground” 需另加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subsetneq V\">\\(W\\subsetneq V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Ground Axiom 断言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 不是任何真内模型的非平凡集合迫使扩张；它不否认真内模型本身存在。</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-ground-model</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-forcing-ground</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-inner2-ground-model</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-inner4-ground-model</code>, and <code>58-df-zfc-model8-ground-model</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"150182b44c47c043","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"1de28866aa4ef668","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"150182b44c47c043","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S$ (含所有序数的传递 ZFC 类模型谓词, see [[58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"1de28866aa4ef668","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S$ (集合迫使扩张谓词, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&W\\subseteq V\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(W)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists P,G\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(V,W,P,G)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"W\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"V=W[G]","display":false},{"tex":"W=V","display":false},{"tex":"W\\subsetneq V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1792,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca5826466e6c6854","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a67179798199b644","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal V,\\mathbb M\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S$ is the class-ground predicate from [[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]."},{"id":"031def7d5c89ab92","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]])"},{"id":"49fccdf1ada96726","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]])"},{"id":"2580bb79563bf7ee","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)$ (ground-model predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]])"},{"id":"720ca858152d0d8e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S$ (ground-model predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]])"},{"id":"fd8900b644e39005","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 